  unitName: Half Blood Lira
  unitId: 60273
  unitNumber: 425
  description: A girl with a human mother and demon father. Having lost both her
    parents at an early age Lira spent her days living in a demon village even despite
    the harsh gazes she received from those around her. Doing everything she could
    as a demon in order to survive, one day she was given a new responsibility. She
    was to defeat the White Beast. Apathetic as always, Lira headed out with Golem,
    which she had received from her father, to face the White Beast.
  summonDesc: I am Lira, a half blood!<br>You should fear me!<br>However, if you
    don't...
  fusionDesc: I must become a strong demon.<br>Please, give me more power!
